              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "suepers"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wonderful! I used mozzarella balls - so much easier! - and marinated them and the tomatoes in olive oil/basil/garlic powder for a couple of hours. These were devoured quickly!",
            "datePublished": "2019-01-02T14:19:12.160Z"
